blue94/react-step-form","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Here I create a fluid , step form with React. A step form is a form broken down into steps. Here I create a step for \"FirstName,LastName,Email\", a second step for \"Instrument,City,Bio\", a third step for a chance for the user to review and confirm the date the put into the form. I use State and props to keep track of the step I was in(0-4). With functions like nextStep and prevStep I was able to add or take away form state.step. The value of Step determines what I Component I have UserForm return.","topics":[],"score":211585,"global_rank":271798},{"name":"AlvianJoseph/201-git-test","owner":"AlvianJoseph","html_url":"https://github.com/AlvianJoseph/201-git-test","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"This is a test for github","topics":[],"score":211585,"global_rank":271801},{"name":"jehns/mongo-crud","owner":"jehns","html_url":"https://github.com/jehns/mongo-crud","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211585,"global_rank":271802},{"name":"ArpanaGeorge/bamazon","owner":"ArpanaGeorge","html_url":"https://github.com/ArpanaGeorge/bamazon","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211585,"global_rank":271809},{"name":"PageTMcEneaney/Word-Guess-Game","owner":"PageTMcEneaney","html_url":"https://github.com/PageTMcEneaney/Word-Guess-Game","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Hangman based game with a space theme. Make sure to turn your sound on after you guess correctly.","topics":[],"score":211585,"global_rank":271814},{"name":"ohthatmarissa/countup","owner":"ohthatmarissa","html_url":"https://github.com/ohthatmarissa/countup","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Simple counting site using js/jquery 